<style>
    .portfolio-container {
        padding: 40px 0px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .portfolio-heading-wrapper {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .portfolio-heading-wrapper h1 {
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #1c0030;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        font-size: 2.5rem;
    }

    .heading-underline {
        width: 100px;
        height: 5px;
        background-color: #53018b;
        border-radius: 25px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .portfolio-container p {
        color: #1c0030;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.8;
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 50px;
        max-width: 800px;
    }

    .portfolio-card-container {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 40px;
        justify-content: center;
    }

    .portfolio-card {
        background-color: #fff;
        border-radius: 15px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 350px;
        transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    }

    .portfolio-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-10px);
        box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    }

    .portfolio-card-header {
        background: #d5d2f2;
        color: #53018b;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        position: relative;
    }

    .portfolio-card-header h5 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .portfolio-card-header .icon {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        opacity: 0.2;
    }

    .portfolio-card-content {
        padding: 20px;
    }

    .portfolio-card-content p {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    /* media queries */
    @media (max-width: 992px) {
        .portfolio-card-container {
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .portfolio-card {
            width: 100%;
        }
    }
</style>

<div class="portfolio-container">
    <div class="portfolio-heading-wrapper">
        <h1>Portfolio</h1>
        <div class="heading-underline"></div>
    </div>
    <p>Explore our range of projects that highlight our commitment to excellence and innovation.</p>
    <div class="portfolio-card-container">
        <div class="portfolio-card">
            <div class="portfolio-card-header">
                <i class="fas fa-briefcase icon"></i>
                <h5>ProjectApply.app</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="portfolio-card-content">
                <p>An AI-driven job search platform that assists users in finding ideal job opportunities, applying, and answering common queries on job boards. It features a LinkedIn extension with similar capabilities.</p>
                <strong>Technology Used:</strong> NodeJS, React, PostgreSQL, AWS, OpenAI, LinkedIn API, Stripe
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="portfolio-card">
            <div class="portfolio-card-header">
                <i class="fas fa-robot icon"></i>
                <h5>AI Automation</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="portfolio-card-content">
                <p>An automated solution that manages every phase of a work order, from initial email receipt to finalization or cancellation, including automatic status updates and customer notifications.</p>
                <strong>Technology Used:</strong> Python, PostgreSQL, AWS, SendGrid, Twilio
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="portfolio-card">
            <div class="portfolio-card-header">
                <i class="fas fa-store icon"></i>
                <h5>AI Store</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="portfolio-card-content">
                <p>A store powered by AI where users can generate, modify, and create products from images generated through conversations.</p>
                <strong>Technology Used:</strong> OpenAI, Squarespace, Printify, Stripe, NodeJS, PostgreSQL, AWS EC2, S3
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="portfolio-card">
            <div class="portfolio-card-header">
                <i class="fas fa-image icon"></i>
                <h5>Alohaimages.co</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="portfolio-card-content">
                <p>A premium media purchasing platform offering users a curated selection from over 100 million images, with personalized suggestions based on user history and preferences.</p>
                <strong>Technology Used:</strong> NodeJS, Python, React, MongoDB, AWS, Stripe
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="portfolio-card">
            <div class="portfolio-card-header">
                <i class="fas fa-boxes icon"></i>
                <h5>Centralized Inventory</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="portfolio-card-content">
                <p>A backend system that automates order management across various e-commerce platforms, synchronizes stock, and predicts sales trends to notify vendors of potential stock shortages.</p>
                <strong>Technology Used:</strong> Python, PostgreSQL, Azure, React
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/a076d05399.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
